  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 802.07 Service area",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 802.07 “Service area” means one of 9 major river basins, organized as modified HUC 8-digit watersheds, that contains the jurisdictional area(s) impacted by a project and how ARM funds are collected and disbursed to offset losses of aquatic resources.\n\nSource. #12808, eff 12-15-19 (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 800)",
